<div id="situations-page"
     data-controller="situations"
     data-situations-cesium-token-value="<%= ENV['CESIUM_ION_TOKEN'] %>">
  <div id="situations-viewer"></div>

  <div class="sit-header">
    <div class="sit-header-title">SITUATIONS</div>
    <div class="sit-header-sub" data-situations-target="status">Loading…</div>
  </div>

  <div class="sit-list" data-situations-target="list"></div>

  <div class="sit-panel" data-situations-target="panel" style="display:none;"></div>

  <div class="sit-scrub" data-situations-target="scrub" style="display:none;">
    <button type="button" class="sit-scrub-live" data-action="click->situations#scrubLive">LIVE</button>
    <input type="range" class="sit-scrub-range" min="0" max="1000" value="1000"
           data-situations-target="scrubRange" data-action="input->situations#scrub"
           aria-label="Replay: drag back in time">
    <span class="sit-scrub-time" data-situations-target="scrubTime">now</span>
  </div>

  <div class="sit-legend">
    <div class="sit-legend-row">
      <span class="sit-swatch sit-swatch-registry"></span>
      <span>Anchored on a registry entity</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sit-legend-row">
      <span class="sit-swatch sit-swatch-medoid"></span>
      <span>No place of its own — drawn at its most central report</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sit-legend-row">
      <span class="sit-line sit-line-evidence"></span>
      <span>Reports converging on the anchor</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sit-legend-row">
      <span class="sit-swatch sit-swatch-asset"></span>
      <span>Assets standing beside the anchor</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sit-legend-row">
      <span class="sit-line sit-line-exposure"></span>
      <span>Countries exposed through the anchor</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sit-legend-note">
      A footprint is drawn on the ground at every distance, so it foreshortens
      toward the limb like the ground it covers. Its radius is the extent of the
      thing named — never how much was written about it. The dot marks one too
      small to see yet.
    </div>
    <div class="sit-legend-note">
      Selecting a situation adds live layers — aircraft, ships, cameras,
      quakes and more. A curator picks which start on; the chips in the dossier
      override it.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
